Specifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/specs/itanium-grammar.txt is a transcription of the grammar productions from
the Itanium C++ ABI (https://itanium-cxx-abi.github.io/cxx-abi/abi.html), included
for reference while reading the parser.
